436400690</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770020019436400690\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T09:30:32Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>qme</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770030781756239986":{"a":"<p>My Grandpa Art Davis ran The Lighthouse Inn in Lebanon Indiana for decades. Fried Chicken every day. 1939 WWII 80% of draftees were rejected due to malnutrition. Grandpa and many others opened restaurants along highways near military bases to feed workers. I spent many hours of… t.co</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770030781756239986\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770030781756239986</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770030781756239986</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770030781756239986\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T10:13:18Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770033256022290755":{"a":"<p>Whoops, forgot to turn in my badge to security that year. 😂😜🏎️ t.co</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1770018636494766093\">https://x.com/i/status/1770018636494766093</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770033256022290755\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770033256022290755</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770033256022290755</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770033256022290755\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T10:23:08Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770043461284085854":{"a":"<p>@IndyScott Really was great! First Hoosier 100 AJ&#x27;s driver punched a hole in the radiator. Driver starts to get out of the car and AJ screams, &quot;What the hell are you doing!?&quot; Driver says &quot;We don&#x27;t have time to fix it.&quot; AJ grabs a sledgehammer and smashes the hole closed and says &quot;Get back…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1770039395363504509\">https://x.com/i/status/1770039395363504509</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/IndyScott/status/1770039395363504509\">https://x.com/IndyScott/status/1770039395363504509</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770043461284085854</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770043461284085854\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T11:03:41Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770044632404992114":{"a":"<p>@IndyScott Every time my mother would walk up to AJ he would roll his eyes and say, &quot;Oh, it&#x27;s you. How are you?&quot; 😂 He gave my mother a bunch of stuff at the estate auction. My mother bought the wheel that hit the wall on his last NASCAR race for $50. Dude that rented the house broke into…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1770043461284085854\">https://x.com/i/status/1770043461284085854</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770044632404992114</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770044632404992114\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T11:08:20Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770045630083183103":{"a":"<p>@IndyScott He gave her a signed rubber check made of actual rubber. 😂 t.co</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1770044632404992114\">https://x.com/i/status/1770044632404992114</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770045630083183103\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770045630083183103</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770045630083183103</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770045630083183103\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T11:12:18Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770047594770665743":{"a":"<p>@IndyScott Hehe, nope, it was $25 for 1.00 wheels. 😂 What, did they sell half a wheel to someone? AJ was fun when he wasn&#x27;t pissed off at some broken machine. t.co</p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1770045630083183103\">https://x.com/i/status/1770045630083183103</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770047594770665743\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770047594770665743</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770047594770665743</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770047594770665743\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T11:20:07Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770047888502014439":{"a":"<p>@IndyScott He HATED computers but put up with them if they won him a race.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1770047790283886677\">https://x.com/i/status/1770047790283886677</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/IndyScott/status/1770047790283886677\">https://x.com/IndyScott/status/1770047790283886677</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770047888502014439</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770047888502014439\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T11:21:17Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770048818341409257":{"a":"<p>@IndyScott I forgot about the posters. Lost in one of many moves I fear. I have a bunch of like 8x10 poster type things I think. I&#x27;ll have to dig those out and look. I&#x27;m on a mission to find a photo of great grandma Hughes and the first graduating class of the pediatric nursing school in St…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1770048166706008087\">https://x.com/i/status/1770048166706008087</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/IndyScott/status/1770048166706008087\">https://x.com/IndyScott/status/1770048166706008087</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770048818341409257</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770048818341409257\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T11:24:58Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770057108890734855":{"a":"<p>@IndyScott Hey @IndyScott do you recall the name of the old man who I think was related to Champion? We sat on the couch at Russ&#x27; and chatted with him. He was like 99 and had a man servant. That last night before the last USAC race at IMS?</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1770045630083183103\">https://x.com/i/status/1770045630083183103</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770057108890734855</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770057108890734855\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T11:57:55Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770063319748997215":{"a":"<p>Imagine if these homes were allowed to be pretty, permanent, and within a well groomed garden space. City Codes are insidious in how they force all homes to be multi-room family dwellings. We had houses like this on our family farm and they were wonderful. This looks sad/lonely. <a href=\"https://x.com/pschofie79/status/1769789173446107191\">Tweet by @pschofie79</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/pschofie79/status/1769789173446107191\">https://x.com/pschofie79/status/1769789173446107191</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770063319748997215</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770063319748997215\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T12:22:36Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770063951142809999":{"a":"<p>@IndyScott I&#x27;m not even sure I knew. I was so engrossed in hearing him talk about how the Indy 500 changed over the 80 years he had attended that I didn&#x27;t think to even remember his name. All I remember is that he was related to Champion somehow.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1770063590793368063\">https://x.com/i/status/1770063590793368063</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/IndyScott/status/1770063590793368063\">https://x.com/IndyScott/status/1770063590793368063</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770063951142809999</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770063951142809999\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T12:25:06Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770072931135041974":{"a":"<p>Two of my favorite things: Gregorian chant and Metallica. 🫶<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t8owYGt