ikes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770120618337304639":{"a":"<p>@JesseForIndy This, in no way, surprises me having spoken to said people in the past about holding events there. 🤦‍♂️</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1770118776496799792\">https://x.com/i/status/1770118776496799792</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/JesseForIndy/status/1770118776496799792\">https://x.com/JesseForIndy/status/1770118776496799792</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770120618337304639</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770120618337304639\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T16:10:17Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770122512472412485":{"a":"<p>They have a policy of tricking people into converting their F zoned property into C/R. When they did away with homestead they failed to mention that they would rezone my property from F3 to R2 or whatever if I agreed to merge all my adjacent properties. I bought it for the F3. 😤 <a href=\"https://t.co/377r2krFzj\">t.co/377r2krFzj</a></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1770122512472412485</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770122512472412485\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T16:17:48Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770123409155907904":{"a":"<p>I learned from mafia types in my youth that the best way to ensure you never hear from someone again is to loan them money. It might be worth it to someone to make sure he never calls them. 😂 It totally works on the right kind of people. I have done that more than once. <a href=\"https://x.com/BobGolen/status/1769892570862129215\">Tweet by @BobGolen</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/BobGolen/status/1769892570862129215\">https://x.com/BobGolen/status/1769892570862129215</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770123409155907904</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770123409155907904\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T16:21:22Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770195868542513608":{"a":"<p>That&#x27;s slightly better. It really bugs me that the photo is not square on the paper. Lucy would probably find that hilarious. 😈 Parallelogram it is I guess. I stuck some cork on the backing so hopefully it wouldn&#x27;t slide around. t.co</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1770020019436400690\">https://x.com/i/status/1770020019436400690</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770195868542513608\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770195868542513608</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770195868542513608</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770195868542513608\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T21:09:18Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770199779630583839":{"a":"<p>It is interesting to watch Citrix and/or VMWare folks be forced to look up from their desk and realize they might have made a grave error by putting their entire chicken farm in one basket for the sake of temporary convenience. From my perspective both virtualization systems were…</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1770199779630583839</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770199779630583839\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T21:24:50Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1770200917985694135":{"a":"<p>I wonder if kids can imagine that this is what NASA used for sending and receiving text messages aboard spacecraft when their parents were their age. 😂 I want to point that I had a similar machine in my garage for exactly the same purpose. I got it from an automotive repair shop… <a href=\"https://x.com/kenshirriff/status/1770188240777044079\">Tweet by @kenshirriff</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/kenshirriff/status/1770188240777044079\">https://x.com/kenshirriff/status/1770188240777044079</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1770200917985694135</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1770200917985694135\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-19T21:29:22Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"}}